    <h2>Install — Rust 1.96+</h2>
<pre class="install-block">git clone https://github.com/atomdrift-project/hood.git
cd hood
make install
hood install</pre>
    <p>Restart your shell and use your tools as before. <code>hood install</code>
    adds the shims; <code>hood uninstall</code> removes them and the shell
    configuration it wrote. Set <code>HOOD_VERBOSE=1</code> (or
    <code>-v</code>) to see each verdict and a summary:</p>
<pre class="install-block">✅ Atomdrift Hood scan passed — 3.2% risk score — package.tgz
⚠️ Atomdrift Hood flagged this download as suspicious — 31.0% risk score — BLOCKED
🛑 Atomdrift Hood blocked a high-risk download — 87.0% risk score</pre>

